abstract: >-
  Competition micromouse firmware for ESP32-S3 (Arduino / PlatformIO) featuring
  hardware PCNT quadrature decoding, phase-script position-PID motion, and a
  16×16 flood-fill BFS maze solver. Placed 3rd overall at the 2026 All America
  Micromouse Contest (AAMC @ UCLA IEEE).
